-shiji-116-xinanyi:m009-0100","c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m009-0127"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p005","c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p006","c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p009"],"table_cell_ids":[],"passage_count":3}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji116-xinanyi"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"h0h_wsl_1nf","title":"滇王","surname":null,"ming":"嘗羌","additional_names":["當羌"],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p005","quote":"及元狩元年，博望侯張騫使大夏來，言居大夏時見蜀布、邛竹、杖，使問所從來，曰「從東南身毒國，可數千里，得蜀賈人市」。或聞邛西可二千里有身毒國。騫因盛言大夏在漢西南，慕中國，患匈奴隔其道，誠通蜀，身毒國道便近，有利無害。於是天子乃令王然于、柏始昌、呂越人等，使閒出西夷西，指求身毒國。至滇，滇王嘗羌乃留，為求道西十餘輩。歲餘，皆閉昆明，莫能通身毒國。","references":[{"title":"《漢書》卷九十五·顏師古注與宋祁校語","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0007/blob/683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454/KR2a0007_095.txt#L74-L75","quote":"(而出/也)指求身毒國至滇滇王當羌廼留為求道(師古曰/當羌滇)¶\n(王名○宋祁曰遷史當/作嘗注云嘗一作賞)四嵗餘(宋祁曰据遷史當云為/求道西此四字當屬上)¶","scope":"ancient_commentary_name_components","image_verified":false,"reviewed_line_range":[74,75]}],"note":"依史記正文保名嘗羌；漢書正文及顏師古注作當羌，宋祁另記遷史嘗字與注中賞字異讀。古注所報賞字不當本次已親見另一版本；不補姓，不由王印推墓主或親屬。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-116","source_id":"s-shiji116-xinanyi"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m005-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"嘗羌","kind":"person","person_id":"h0h_wsl_1nf","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-116-xinanyi:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"滇王","kind